  "step_2": "The individual mentions 'zu hohe Chance zu verlieren in der anderen Lotterie' (translated: 'too high a chance of losing in the other lottery'). This indicates that the individual focused on the risk of loss in Lottery B, particularly the 50% chance of losing 6000 Euros. The individual appears to have considered the probability of a negative outcome and found it unacceptably high. The justification centers on avoiding loss rather than comparing outcome ranges or spreads. No mention is made of the spread between best and worst outcomes, nor of the maximum gains possible.",
